WKV8pT50a5N3xCwmxCCUS.jpg"},{"id":1683530,"name":"Dashmir Ristemi","role":"Taxifahrer Zürich"},{"id":1439720,"name":"Wulf Schmid-Noerr","role":"Parkender Opa"},{"id":65080,"name":"Annette Wunsch","role":"Erlebnispark Kassiererin"},{"id":1179507,"name":"Tamer Arslan","role":"Gökhan","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5yJy12iFAFU20yiAFoC05Ps4FnI.jpg"},{"id":6297629,"name":"Shuya Zhang","role":"Supermarket Guest"},{"id":5367021,"name":"Sabrina Dietel","role":"Frau Schmidt-Thiedemann"},{"id":6297653,"name":"Paul Dickhaut","role":"Sohn im Stau"},{"id":6297663,"name":"Thomas Kahl","role":"Bankmitarbeiter"},{"id":6297682,"name":"Aki Tagatatsu","role":"Streichelzoo Mama"},{"id":6297684,"name":"Hana Tagatatsu","role":"Streichelzoo Kind"},{"id":6297688,"name":"Georg Horn","role":"Sky Shot Mitarbeiter"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"I pesci rossi","overview":"Oliver è un manager bancario. La sua vita va a gonfie vele fino al giorno in cui ha un terribile incidente automobilistico. Quando si risvegli in ospedale, scopre di essere diventato paraplegico. Per diverso tempo, deve seguire una terapia di riabilitazione e per tale ragione finisce in un gruppo composto dalla cinica cieca Magda, dagli autistici Rainman e Michi, e da Franzi, affetta dalla sindrome di Down. Ad assisterli vi sono l'idealista Laura e il più esaurito Eddy. Rapidamente nella mente di Oliver si fa strada un piano: usare il gruppo per raggiungere in incognito la Svizzera, dove ha una pila di denaro in nero di cui riappropriarsi."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Goldfish","overview":"Oliver is a banker and portfolio manager and leads a life in the fast lane, which one day comes to an abrupt end, as he builds a self-inflicted accident on highway with 230 km / h and raced through a guardrail. When he wakes up in the hospital again, he faces a devastating diagnosis: paraplegia. Actually, a rehabilitation stay of several months is planned in the hospital, but Oliver soon falls on his head and ends up in a disabled shared flat with the name \"Die Goldfische\""},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Das Leben des Bankers Oliver wird nach einem schweren Unfall auf den Kopf gestellt. Mit über 200 Sachen rast der Lebemann nämlich in eine Leitplanke und ist nach dem Crash querschnittsgelähmt. Nach der Reha zieht er in eine WG körperlich behinderter Menschen ein. Eigentlich sollte er sein Leben nun völlig neu überdenken, doch stattdessen verleiten seine neuen Umstände Oliver zu einem kriminellen Plan: Er will nach Zürich reisen, um in der Schweiz eine beträchtliche Summe an Schwarzgeld an sich zu bringen. Das illegale Unterfangen führt ihn dabei auf eine abenteuerliche Reise.","tagline":"Mach ma so, hamma kein Stress."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cgBTwAkjINU8FYT5bgYB6DuInic.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mfvJQLVu7g3cYMOLmSVpSs3vIdL.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":535092,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cgBTwAkjINU8FYT5bgYB6DuInic.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cgBTwAkjINU8FYT5bgYB6DuInic.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cgBTwAkjINU8FYT5bgYB6DuInic.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cgBTwAkjINU8FYT5bgYB6DuInic.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/arqU72w8tkCGCIKEul476of8qZE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/arqU72w8tkCGCIKEul476of8qZE.jpg","language":"en","width":1280,"height":1897},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/arqU72w8tkCGCIK